This directory contains test alignments: 
- distributed together with Sean Eddy's easel library: https://github.com/EddyRivasLab/easel
- from the balibase MSA benchmark: https://www.lbgi.fr/balibase/


- sl_ties/: constructed DNA inputs with tied guide-tree distances (5/41 and
  15/123 as normalised Myers distances), used by the kalign_sl_ties_* tests.
